ertcbrown/ard/blob/8183f9a35d7b9a9405602a4515ecbd6f01052fcf/.ard/217/triage-engineer.md) · log [.ard/217/logs/triage-engineer-20261123T223006.815Z.log](https://github.com/albertcbrown/ard/blob/8183f9a35d7b9a9405602a4515ecbd6f01052fcf/.ard/217/logs/triage-engineer-20261123T223006.815Z.log) · job `01M858FQ9KC8P8DV4DNQ8RGTPH` · attempt 1\n\n\n# Plan for #217\n\n## Implementation\n\n### Steps\n\nChecked against the tree: #216 has landed (role dir `internal/roles/scanners/trufflehog/` with `scan`, `findings.jq`, `exclude-paths`, `Dockerfile` with `ARG TRUFFLEHOG_VERSION=3.100.0`; `internal/roles/trufflehog_test.go` with `th`-prefixed helpers `thFake`, `thRun`, `thRunFull`, `thResult`, `thLine`; proposal Scanners row, starter list and config line; `docs/layout.md` already lists `scanners/trufflehog`). Note: CLAUDE.md no longer has an `internal/roles/` line; its Layout section points to `docs/layout.md`, so CLAUDE.md needs no change.\n\n1. New `internal/roles/trufflehog_integration_test.go`, `//go:build integration`, package `roles`. Reuse `needTools`, `decode` (`cve_test.go`) and `scanner.DecodeFindings`. Do not redefine the existing `th*` names; new helpers use a distinct prefix such as `thi`.\n   - Helper `thiPinnedVersion(t) string`: read the `ARG TRUFFLEHOG_VERSION=` line of `scanners/trufflehog/Dockerfile`.\n   - Helper `thiBin(t) string`: `ARD_TRUFFLEHOG_BIN`; `t.Skip` only when unset. When set, run `<bin> --version` and `t.Fatalf` (never skip) unless the output contains the pinned version. Comment: how to get the binary (release tarball for the host OS at the pinned version, checked against the release's checksums file).\n   - Helper `thiPlantRepo(t) (repo string, planted []string)`: build a temp repo at run time with `crypto/rand` values from the detector alphabet, prefixes joined from pieces (e.g. `\"AK\"+\"IA\"`), neutral variable names, no credential-shaped literal in source. Contents: A (AWS-shaped key ID plus nearby secret) in `a/one.env` and `b/two.env`; B (